#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Root supervisor and per-turn sandbox for one hostile provider CLI.

The trusted server invokes this immutable program through one narrow sudoers
rule. It consumes a server-owned launch manifest, opens every allowed path
before dropping privilege, then runs the provider through bubblewrap with a
private PID/mount/IPC/UTS scope. This process remains root, acts as a Linux
child subreaper, and proves every descendant has exited before returning.
"""

